        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Florida Board of Regents, State University System of Florida, Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education\n- People: Judy Hample\n- Places: Florida, United States\n\nFacts:\n- From 1965 to 2001, the Florida Board of Regents was the governing body for the State University System of Florida.\n- The State University System of Florida includes all public universities in Florida.\n- The State University System of Florida is a system of twelve public universities in the U.S. state of Florida.\n- Judy Hample is a former chancellor of the Florida Board of Regents.\n- Judy Hample is a former chancellor of the Pennsylvania State System of Higher Education.",
